cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit, please cite it as below, together with the study evidence and the protocol."
type: software
title: "honesty-harness-toolkit"
authors:
  - family-names: "Castellanos Macias"
    given-names: "Ricardo"
version: 0.1.0-rc1
date-released: "2026-09-19"
license: MIT
# doi: PENDING — assigned at the Zenodo release of the toolkit.
abstract: >-
  Walk-forward backtesting engine plus an experimental-honesty protocol
  (pre-registration frozen by hash before results, one cardinal a-priori
  metric, drift-0 GBM placebo as the noise floor of best-of-N selection,
  anti-leakage gates, asymmetric verdicts), extracted from a study that
  returned a negative result for its own strategy family.
references:
